@startuml state-artwork
!pragma layout smetana
!include _style.iuml
title Artwork Status (what shoppers can do)

[*] --> available : priced, photo added
[*] --> inquire_only : no price yet
[*] --> portfolio : not for sale
available : Buy now (+ sizes, sale price)
inquire_only : "On request" + Ask about it
sold_out : "Sold" tag, no purchase
hidden : not on the site
portfolio : About page gallery only

available --> sold_out : last item paid\n(webhook)
available --> inquire_only : artist edits
inquire_only --> available : artist sets price
sold_out --> available : artist restocks
available --> hidden : artist hides
hidden --> available : artist shows
portfolio --> available : artist decides to sell
available --> [*] : artist deletes\n(blocked if orders exist)
@enduml
